"artworkUrl512":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/0e/df/12/0edf1230-3f6e-fbb3-7f72-f2aa844d100a/AppIcons-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg", "averageUserRating":4.81289999999999995594635038287378847599029541015625, "trackCensoredName":"Stardew Valley", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stardew-valley/id1406710800?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "genres":["Games", "Entertainment", "Roleplaying", "Simulation"], "artistId":1620477446, "artistName":"ConcernedApe", "price":4.99, "trackId":1406710800, "trackName":"Stardew Valley", "releaseDate":"2018-10-24T07:00:00Z", "genreIds":["6014", "6016", "7014", "7015"], "primaryGenreName":"Games", "primaryGenreId":6014, "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "sellerName":"ConcernedApe LLC", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-03-19T00:31:54Z", "version":"1.6.15.1", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Move to the countryside, and cultivate a new life in this award-winning open-ended farming RPG! With over 50+ hours of gameplay content and new Mobile-specific features, such as auto-save and multiple controls options.\n\n**Winner of the Golden Joysticks' Breakthrough Award**\n**Nominee of Game of the Year 2017 - BAFTA Games Awards**\n\n---\n\nBUILD THE FARM OF YOUR DREAMS:\n\n■ Turn your overgrown fields into a lively and bountiful farm\n\n■ Raise and breed happy animals, grow a variety of seasonal crops and design your farm, your way\n\n■ Customize your farmer and home! With hundreds of options to choose from\n\n■ Settle down and start a family with 12 potential marriage candidates\n\n■ Become part of the community by taking part in seasonal festivals and villager quests\n\n■ Explore vast, mysterious caves, encountering dangerous monsters and valuable treasure\n\n■ Spend a relaxing afternoon at one of the local fishing spots or go crabbing by the seaside\n\n■ Forage, grow crops and produce artisan goods to cook up as a delicious meal\n\n■ Rebuilt for touch-screen gameplay on iOS with mobile-specific features, such as auto-select to toggle quickly between your farming tools and auto-attack to swiftly take down fiendish monsters in the mines\n\n■ Continue farming from where you last left off with auto-save (even if you close the app!)\n\n■ Play the game your way with multiple controls options, such as touch-screen and virtual joystick\n\n■ Newly Updated Single Player Content - Including new town upgrades, dating events, crops, fishing ponds, hats, clothing, and new pets! Plus more to be discovered...\n\n---\n\n“The best version of Stardew Valley is the one you have with you … This game is absolutely incredible, and will not disappoint.” - TouchArcade\n\n\"Stardew Valley beautifully combines farm simulation with RPG elements to create an intriguing, absorbing rural world.\" - IGN\n\n“Far more than just a farming game... filled with seemingly endless content and heart.” Giant Bomb\n\n\"Village life has never been so accessible and satisfying\" - The Telegraph\n\n“Stardew Valley has been the most rich and heartwarming experience I’ve had in a game in years.” CG Magazine\n\n---\n\nNote: Features new 1.6 update story content, multiplayer functionality not supported. No in-app purchases.", "bundleId":"com.chucklefish.stardewvalley", "minimumOsVersion":"13.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.81289999999999995594635038287378847599029541015625, "sellerUrl":"https://www.stardewvalley.net/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "HU", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PT", "RU", "ES", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes":"463694848", "formattedPrice":"$4.99", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":63639, "trackContentRating":"12+", 
"releaseNotes":"- Added Game Center support\n- Added a leaderboard for Junimo Kart endless mode\n- Added a leaderboard for the deepest mine level reached in Skull Cavern\n- Fixed bug where moving buildings at Robin's could make them disappear\n- Pets will no longer randomly change breeds when using Shrine of Illusions\n- Fixed a crash when selling items in shops using a gamepad\n- Patched an infinite money exploit when combining touch and gamepad controls\n- Patched an infinite item glitch when interacting with the tailoring menu\n- The tailoring menu will no longer unintentionally delete your equipped clothes\n- Fixed a rare bug that made some 1.5.6 saves unable to load in 1.6", "userRatingCount":63639}, 
