"description":"Looking for help or the latest tips for Stardew Valley? This all-in-one solution is exactly what you need to enhance your gameplay and improve your skills. It caters to both novice and experienced players and, once downloaded, does not require an internet connection for daily use—ensuring that essential information is always at your fingertips.\n\nLanguages:\nThe database is available in the following languages:\n• Chinese (中文)\n• English\n• French (Français)\n• German (Deutsch)\n• Hungarian (Magyar)\n• Italian (Italiano)\n• Japanese (日本語)\n• Korean (한국어)\n• Portuguese (Português)\n• Russian (Русский)\n• Spanish (Español)\n• Turkish (Türkçe)\n\nFeatures:\n• Achievements\n• Crafting\n• Drops\n• Environment details\n• Guides\n• Hints\n• In-game news\n• Items\n• Quests\n• Recipes\n• Tips\n• Tricks\n• Videos\n\nAdditional Benefits:\n• Ability to add or remove objects from favorites\n• Ability to sort objects by category, name, or type\n• Customizable font size, style, and color themes for a personalized reading experience\n• Dark theme for comfortable viewing\n• Easy navigation throughout the app\n• Interconnected objects: navigate from a recipe directly to its ingredients and explore related items seamlessly\n• List of recently viewed objects for quick reference\n• Optimized for both iPad and iPhone\n• Powerful text search and object name search functionality\n• Works offline once the database is downloaded (internet connection required only for heavy files like videos or animated GIFs)\n• Zoom functionality for images and text\n\nContent Overview:\n• Comprehensive guides, hints, tips, and tricks to support both beginners and experienced players\n• Detailed information on items and recipes, including images, ingredients, and stats\n• Latest news and engaging videos about Stardew Valley\n\nPerformance:\nThe app is fully optimized for all Apple mobile devices. With the database downloaded, you can access all essential game information even in offline scenarios such as when you’re on the subway.\n\n\nFeedback:\nFor any requests, suggestions, or comments, please use the \"Feedback\" option within the app or email me at kateryna.momotova@yahoo.com. Your positive reviews are highly appreciated, and if you would like to help with translations, please get in touch via email.\n\n\nLicense:\nContent is available under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0) unless otherwise noted.\n\nNote:\nThis app is unofficial and is not affiliated with the game’s developer, publisher, or distributor. All in-game content, imagery, text, and videos are the property of their respective owners. This reference app is designed solely for informational purposes to assist fans alongside playing the game. It may include information sourced from freely available online resources. If you have any concerns or believe there is a copyright or trademark issue that falls outside of \"fair use,\" please contact me directly at kateryna.momotova@yahoo.com.\n\n\nSubscription Details:\nYour payment will be charged to your iTunes account once you confirm your purchase. Your iTunes account will be charged again when your subscription automatically renews at the end of your current period unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours prior to the period’s end. You can manage or turn off auto-renew in your Apple ID account settings at any time after purchase.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://telegra.ph/Terms--Conditions-02-13.\n\nTerms & Conditions: https://telegra.ph/Privacy-Policy-02-13-6.", "bundleId":"com.momotova.databaseforstardewvalley", "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.76363000000000003097966327914036810398101806640625, "sellerUrl":"http://www.momotov.com", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "HU", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "TH", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes":"168663040", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":4015, "trackContentRating":"9+", 
"releaseNotes":"This update includes bug fixes and an updated database to match the latest game version.\n\nIf you have any requests, suggestions, or comments, please send them via the \"Feedback\" feature in the app or email me at kateryna.momotova@yahoo.com. I’d be happy and motivated if you could leave a positive review of my work. Thank you! :)", "userRatingCount":4015}, 
