"description":"Whether you're a seasoned farmer or just starting out, this comprehensive Stardew Valley companion app is designed to be your guide to tracking progress, planning efficiently, and helps you unlock every secret the valley has to offer.\n\n- Complete Item Database\nInstant access to details and checklists for everything in the game: Shipped Items, Fish, Artifacts, Minerals, Cooking & Crafting Recipes, Furniture, Buildings, Shops, Clothing, Weapons, Tools, Villagers, Monsters, Pets, and Farm Animals.\n\n- Perfection & Collection Trackers\nTrack everything you’ve acquired and see what’s left to reach 100% completion.\n\n- Villager Gift Tastes & Schedules\nNever miss a birthday or a chance to boost friendship—view accurate daily schedules for every character.\n\n- Community Center & Joja Guide\nBundle checklist and Joja route planning at your fingertips.\n\n- Golden Walnut Checklist\nHunt down every last Golden Walnut on Ginger Island with ease.\n\n- Building & Upgrade Info\nPlan your farm layout with complete data on all buildings and upgrades.\n\n- Forge & Enchantments Guide\nMaster the Volcano Forge with a breakdown of all weapon and tool enchantments.\n\n- Achievements List\nBrowse and track every in-game achievement as you complete them.\n\n- Skills Tracker\nTrack your skill progress and view unlocks for every level.\n\n- Custom Notes, To-Do List & Calendar\nPlan your seasons with personal notes, a fully editable calendar, and daily to-do lists.\n\n- Multiple Farm Support\nManage and track progress across all your farms.\n\n- Global Search\nQuickly find any item, villager, or topic in seconds.\n\n- Offline & Private\nWorks entirely offline—no internet required and no data is ever collected, stored, or sent anywhere. Your privacy is fully protected.\n\n- 100% Free with NO Ads!\nThe only in-app purchases are for tipping the Developer.\n\n- Available in 12 languages!\nEnglish, Deutsch, Español, Français, Magyar, Italiano, 日本語, 한국어, Português, Русский, Türkçe, 中文\n\nYour journey to Perfection just got easier. Download now and make every day in Stardew Valley count with this full-featured guide for SV!", "bundleId":"com.guntherslibrary.app", "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.97043000000000034788172342814505100250244140625, "sellerUrl":"https://www.bluecaret.com/guntherslibrary/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"43347968", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":372, "trackContentRating":"9+", 
